getting Shiny Pokemon has never been  easier in a Mainline Pokemon game here  are a few strategies that will  significantly increase your odds of  running into a Shiny Pokemon in scarlet  and violet now before we get going I  highly recommend teaching one of your  Pokemon false swipe the last thing you  want to do is to knock out a Shiny  Pokemon before you catch it and this  move will prevent that from happening  you can get the false swipe TM from  Jacques I also recommend picking up  quick balls as these will greatly  improve your catch rates at the  beginning of a battle and using a  Pokemon that can put wild Pokemon to  sleep finally I recommend turning off  autosave in the main menu  Pokemon outbreaks from Legends are CSR  back and this is the best way to find  Shiny Pokemon early on open up your map  to find a Pokemon outbreak head to that  location and start battling the outbreak  Pokemon the more you defeat the more  your odds will improve in general the  odds of running into a Shiny Pokemon are  one out of 4096 however after defeating  30 outbreak Pokemon the odds increased  to 1 out of every 2048. after 60 it goes  to 1 out of 1  365. once you hit 60 save your game and  set up a picnic after you've released  your Pokemon from their pokeballs pack  up the picnic and take a look around if  there are no shinies start up another  picnic and repeat the process try not to  knock out too many more Pokemon because  if you knock out too many the outbreak  will end if that does happen just reload  your save every time you set up and pack  up a picnic all the Pokemon in the area  reset this means that new Pokemon will  load in much quicker than they would  otherwise which means you can burn  through Pokemon spawns far quick keep in  mind that the picnic strategy could be a  bug so it may get patched out eventually  one out of 1 336 still aren't the best  odds fortunately there is a way to  improve shiny odds in Pokemon scarlet  and violet across the board all you need  to do is catch every single Pokemon in  the pound Pokedex and talk to Jack it's  a Time sink and you'll need to  coordinate some trades across versions  but your shiny odds will be globally  adjusted to 1 out of 2048. if you defeat  60 Pokemon during an outbreak that will  improve your odds even further now if  you're really into shiny hunting  completing the Pokedex is 100 worth your  time it can be a pain especially when  there's only a handful of entries left  to fill but it can make this whole  process so much smoother  sandwiches are new to Pokemon scarlet  and violet and they along with a bunch  of other Buffs can dramatically increase  shiny rates the key ingredient is  irvamistica in order to get Urban  mystica you need to unlock 5 Star Terror  rides by completing the game and some  post-game content the catch is that 5  Star raids can be pretty tough  especially by yourself however if you  coordinate with some friends and plan  accordingly you should be able to take  them out if you have no friends you can  match make with other players but  matchmaking isn't super reliable there  are five flavors of urban mystica you  can find salty spicy Sweet Bitter and  sour flavor combinations combined with  an ingredient correspond to different  types for this Pomo I used a yellow bell  pepper and salty and spicy Urban mystica  there are a bunch of combinations that  players are still figuring out so if  you're hunting for a specific shiny I  recommend looking up the proper  ingredients before you start making  Urban mystica sandwiches  the Masuda Method is a shiny hunting  strategy reserved specifically for  Pokemon breeding in order to breed you  need two compatible Pokemon and one must  be from another real world region if  you're unsure what region a Pokemon is  from you can check its summary page the  easiest way to get a Pokemon from  another region is through surprise  traits connect to the internet select  poker portal hit surprise trade and  offer up a Pokemon within seconds you  should get a random Pokemon from another  trainer the other way to get Pokemon  from another region is by starting a new  game and selecting a different language  if you plan on picking up both scarlet  and violet you can set your second game  to a different language ideally you'd  want to catch an alternate ditto so you  can breed any Pokemon with improved odds  of course the shiny charm will improve  your odds even further thanks to  sandwiches you can give your Pokemon an  egg boost which should increase breeding  success this won't increase your shiny  odds but it does mean you'll get more  eggs in a shorter amount of time when  you're hatching I also recommend having  a Pokemon with the ability flame body in  your party because that will also cause  eggs to hatch quicker once you've found  two partner Pokemon make sure they are  the only ones in your party eat an egg  boosting meal and set your switch down  for the next 30 minutes or so once  you're ready check this basket and  you'll have a ton of eggs to hatch shiny  hunting can be a long process but  scarlet and violet have made some  substantial changes that make it much  easier if you have any more tips or  you're just looking for someone to team  up with for a 5 Star raid please leave a  comment down below  thank you  [Music]  thank you
 

